EmailTemplate.textOnly:
{!Contact.FirstName},

On behalf of our advising team, congratulations on your acceptance to Arizona State University and welcome to the T. Denny Sanford School of Social & Family Dynamics! We provide academic advising for ASU Online students in the Sociology & Family/Human Development programs.

Now that you have been admitted, we would like to encourage you to schedule an advising appointment with us.  You can click on the following link to access our online scheduling system: https://webapp4.asu.edu/advsched/?acad_org=CSOCFAM

In preparation for your appointment, please access your DARS (Degree Audit Report) by clicking this link: https://webapp4.asu.edu/dars4webstudent. It shows your remaining degree requirements. You can watch this video on how DARS works: https://vimeo.com/119471478. *Please note that the evaluation of your transfer work may be still be in progress and that this evaluation process can take a few weeks. If you notice the below message in your DARS (Degree Audit Report), your evaluation is not complete.

If you see a message regarding transcript evaluation, we would recommend allowing for a little more time before scheduling your advising appointment.  Once that big red X disappears, your evaluation is complete and we can more fully review your transfer work and outstanding requirements for your degree with you.

We look forward to working with you as you begin your academic journey here at Arizona State.

Sincerely,
{!User.Name}
{!User.Title}
{!User.Phone}
Sanford Online Advising Team

